Field,Data_Type,Description
Order_ID,string,Unique identification number for the order
Order_Date,datetime,Date when the order was placed
Ship_Date,datetime,Date when the order was shipped
Customer_ID,string,Unique identification number for the customer
Category,string,Main product category
Sub_Category,string,Product sub-category
Sales,float,Sales value after discount
Quantity,int,Number of units sold
Discount,float,Discount applied to the order
Profit,float,Profit generated from the order
Shipping_Days,int,Number of days between order and shipment
Gross_Sales,float,Estimated sales before discount
Discount_Amount,float,Estimated monetary value of the discount
Sales_Per_Unit,float,Sales divided by quantity
Profit_Margin,float,Profit as a percentage of sales
Profit_Status,string,Shows whether the transaction generated profit or loss
